4dd3ed3780c4513193645e7d34aabe7c0c9240f9
read: Terra cold read of the ci-container lane HELD on the image pin law (WL3 missed image-bearing fields, the wrapper took any PW_IMAGE), cured red-first (WL3 reads every image-bearing field against the probe's pin, WL4 seven negative controls, WL5 pw-container.sh refuses a non-pinned image before docker runs); a blind Opus read = SHIP, measured no quiet gate; its P3s folded in (stale comment and safe.directory gone, mounts narrowed to the workspace with .git read-only plus PW_MOUNTS, the /proc fallback lists LISTENING sockets only, copyLiveStore proves the copy by a known doc). Proof at this exact head, no reruns: CI 42126382295 (push), 42129408404 (dispatch), Held-out 42126471312 incl. browser-weld, all green. Owed: the image's Node 26 vs the jobs' pinned 24. The head 4dd3ed378 merges the span at 04e5146e8 (PR #162, PR #163) over 85389f46c and adds no lane change; CI 42132914658 green at it.

<<~/ahu>>

